@baseUrl = https://localhost:5071

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Users (copy the operator's Id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users

### Warehouses and locations (copy the Id of A-01 and B-01)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/warehouses

### Products (search is optional; copy the hammer's Id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?search=ham

### Purchase orders (copy the Id of PO-0001)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-orders

### Purchase order detail (copy the line Id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-orders/PASTE-PO-ID

### Receive 60 of 100 (first delivery)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/receipts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseOrderId": "PASTE-PO-ID",
  "receivedByUserId": "PASTE-OPERATOR-USER-ID",
  "idempotencyKey": "aaaaaaaa-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "allowOverReceipt": false,
  "notes": "First delivery",
  "lines": [
    {
      "purchaseOrderLineId": "PASTE-LINE-ID",
      "storageLocationId": "PASTE-LOCATION-A01-ID",
      "quantityAccepted": 60,
      "quantityRejected": 0,
      "discrepancyNote": ""
    }
  ]
}

### Receive the remaining 40 (new idempotency key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/receipts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseOrderId": "PASTE-PO-ID",
  "receivedByUserId": "PASTE-OPERATOR-USER-ID",
  "idempotencyKey": "aaaaaaaa-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "allowOverReceipt": false,
  "notes": "Second delivery",
  "lines": [
    {
      "purchaseOrderLineId": "PASTE-LINE-ID",
      "storageLocationId": "PASTE-LOCATION-A01-ID",
      "quantityAccepted": 40,
      "quantityRejected": 0,
      "discrepancyNote": ""
    }
  ]
}

### Issue 25 units
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/issue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "PASTE-PRODUCT-ID",
  "storageLocationId": "PASTE-LOCATION-A01-ID",
  "quantity": 25,
  "performedByUserId": "PASTE-OPERATOR-USER-ID",
  "idempotencyKey": "bbbbbbbb-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "referenceNumber": "SO-DEMO-1",
  "reason": "Manual issue"
}

### Adjust: decrease by 2 (a reason is required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/adjust
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "PASTE-PRODUCT-ID",
  "storageLocationId": "PASTE-LOCATION-A01-ID",
  "quantity": 2,
  "isIncrease": false,
  "reason": "Damaged during handling",
  "performedByUserId": "PASTE-OPERATOR-USER-ID",
  "idempotencyKey": "cccccccc-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

### Transfer 10 from A-01 to B-01
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "PASTE-PRODUCT-ID",
  "fromStorageLocationId": "PASTE-LOCATION-A01-ID",
  "toStorageLocationId": "PASTE-LOCATION-B01-ID",
  "quantity": 10,
  "reason": "Rebalancing",
  "performedByUserId": "PASTE-OPERATOR-USER-ID",
  "idempotencyKey": "dddddddd-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

### Movement history (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movements?pageSize=25

### Product detail with stock by location
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/PASTE-PRODUCT-ID

### Ledger vs balance check (an empty list [] means consistent)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/reconciliation